# Spectra Converter Completely Portable Executable!

I have updated the application to perfectly match your new requests.

## What Was Added
- **Description & Keywords Options**: I've successfully expanded the UI and updated the background `converter.py` logic to accurately inject `Description` and `Keywords` metadata via universally compatible PNG text chunks (`PngInfo`).
- **Completely Portable Executable (`SpectraConverter.exe`)**: You requested that this app can be sent around securely without forcing other people to install Python! I've used `PyInstaller` to package the entire GUI interface, background logic, and all processing dependencies (`Pillow`, `PieXif`, etc.) into a single, clean `.exe` file!

## How To Share & Use!
You do **not** need the Python scripts, dependencies, or anything else to share this! 

1. Simply copy the `SpectraConverter.exe` file inside of the `dist` folder.
2. Send it to anyone freely via Discord, Google Drive, or Email.
3. They can just **double-click** the file, and the application will instantly boot up on their Windows computer without them needing to install Python or touch terminals!
